    "report_content": "<p><strong>X-ray chest AP view</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Findings:</strong></p><p>\tPosition and outline of the trachea is normal.</p><p>Both hemidiaphragms are normal in position, contour and definition.</p><p>\tArea just below the diaphragm are normal.</p><p>Heart is normal in transverse diameter.</p><p>Inhomogenous opacities are noted at the right upper, mid and lower zones.</p><p>Hila are normal.</p><p>No mediastinal displacement is seen.</p>",
